{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RHPkhTa9151793186560.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>蒙彼利埃乒乓冠軍賽，港隊的杜凱琹女單首圈出局。</p><p></p><p>紫衫的杜凱琹面對日本的早田希娜，首局曾領先8-3，但之後連失7分，輸9-11。</p><p></p><p>過去四次交手，杜凱琹未嘗一勝。第二局全程落後，第三局就一度追至9平手，但都輸7-11及9-11，局數0-3落敗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.623241+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.063798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:29.082222+00:00","content_hash":"0eceab3959e4d5559031e931fbf7393223ed0288dcdb7082d682635ced8e8c72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.623241+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}